id: vehicle-living-quarters
name: Living Quarters
kind: vehicle quality
slots: 2
source: Vehicles
needsSizeAtLeast: enormous
waits: Waits on Bases.
# Its entry as the Vehicles page prints it, word for word.
text: >
  Living Quarters: This Vehicle doubles as a home away from home.
  –Prerequisites: This Vehicle's Size Category is Enormous or Larger.
  –Quality Slots: 2
  –Effects: This Vehicle has all the amenities of a home. This can mean separate rooms in larger Vehicles and tends to
  include a bathroom, kitchen, and dedicated living room. This takes up 2 Squares, which must be aligned either
  vertically or horizontally. These Squares are considered occupied.

  You may use this Vehicle as if it was a Base with the Bedroom and Kitchen Rooms.

---
